[h2]Build 0.9.2[/h2]
[h3]Added[/h3]
[list]
[*]The power suit frame: a hulking armoured exoskeleton, built at the fabrication bench after researching power suits (in the Vanilla Expanded research tab; needs powered armor and warcaskets).
[*]Right-click a standing suit to climb into it, and use the "Climb out" button to leave it standing where you are. Outer armour and headgear are left behind when a colonist climbs in.
[*]Suit pilots can wield the heavy warcasket weapons from Vanilla Factions Expanded - Pirates. Those weapons stay with the suit when the pilot climbs out.
[*]The suit makes its pilot tougher, stronger and able to carry far more, but slower.
[*]Colonists never climb into a suit on their own.
[/list]
